Package: ztR
Title: ztR
Version: 0.0.0.9002
Authors@R: 
    person("Gabriel", "Bertolini", , "gabertol@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3873-6190"))
Description: ZIRCON-TOURMALINE-RUTILE (ZTR). Mineral end-members and crystal chemistry
    calculations for SEM-EDS, EMPA or any mineral chemistry dataset; zircon trace-element
    normalization, ratios and proxies; tidy wrappers around IsoplotR for U-Pb ages and
    ggplot2 layers for concordia diagrams.
